<%= if @subscription.user.first_name do %><%= gettext("Hi %{name},", name: @subscription.user.first_name) %><% else %><%= gettext("Hi,") %><% end %>

<%= gettext("Thank you for subscribing! Your subscription is set up, and I'll choose the flowers for each bouquet myself.") %>

<%= gettext("Size") %>: <%= @size %>
<%= gettext("How often") %>: <%= @interval %>
<%= gettext("Delivered to") %>: <%= @subscription.delivery_address %>
<%= gettext("Next delivery") %>: <%= @format_date.(@subscription.next_fulfillment_date) %>

<%= gettext("Your first delivery comes as ordered, and its receipt is in a separate email. I charge your saved card a few days before each delivery.") %>

<%= gettext("You can skip a delivery, pause, change the size or how often, update your card or cancel from your account:") %>
<%= @account_url %>

<%= gettext("If anything needs changing, just reply and I'll take care of it.") %>

<%= gettext("Warm wishes,") %>

Jennie
Eden Flowers
